            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 items-start">
                <div class="md:col-span-1">
                    <img src="~/images/profile/artem.webp"
                         alt="Artsiom Dusau - Founder of USA Symbol"
                         class="w-full rounded-2xl shadow-lg object-cover">

                    <div class="mt-6 text-center">
                        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/artsiom-dusau/"
                           target="_blank"
                           rel="noopener noreferrer"
                           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-semibold transition">
                            <i class="fa-brands fa-linkedin text-lg"></i>
                            LinkedIn Profile
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="md:col-span-2">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-1">Artsiom Dusau</h3>
                    <p class="text-blue-700 font-semibold mb-1">Founder &amp; Lead Editor</p>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6">Based in Chicago, Illinois</p>

                    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Background</h4>
                        <p class="mb-4">
                            Artsiom is an experienced software engineer with a strong background in web development and
                            a passion for creating accessible educational resources. Originally from Belarus, he moved to
                            the United States and settled in Chicago, where he combines technical expertise with a deep
                            interest in American heritage and diversity.
                        </p>
                        <p class="mb-4">
                            With many years of professional experience in software development, he brings a solid technical
                            foundation to ensure USA Symbol provides a reliable, fast, and user-friendly experience across
                            all devices.
                        </p>

                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 mt-6">Why USA Symbol Exists</h4>
                        <p class="mb-4">
                            "While researching American state symbols, I noticed there wasn't a single, well-organized resource
                            that brought everything together in one accessible place. Information was scattered across government
                            websites, Wikipedia articles, and various educational sites. I wanted to build a systematized,
                            mobile-optimized platform that makes learning about state symbols engaging and straightforward."
                        </p>
                        <p class="mb-4">
                            "Each state has its own identity, history, and symbols that tell important stories. This project
                            combines my software engineering skills with my interest in making educational content accessible
                            to everyone—from students working on school projects to anyone curious about American heritage."
                        </p>

                        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 mt-6">Technical Expertise</h4>
                        <p class="mb-2">
                            Artsiom specializes in full-stack web development, particularly with C#, ASP.NET Core, JavaScript,
                            and modern frontend technologies. This ensures USA Symbol is built on a scalable, maintainable
                            platform designed for long-term reliability and growth.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-lg mb-3">Contact</h4>
                        <a href="/contact" data-email-user="contact" data-email-domain="usasymbol.com"
                           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 font-semibold transition">
                            <i class="fa-regular fa-envelope text-base"></i>
                            contact@usasymbol.com
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- LOCATION SECTION -->
<section class="py-16 px-4">
