                    learning about state symbols engaging and memorable.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- RESEARCH METHODOLOGY -->
<section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-10 text-center">
            Our Research Methodology
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 fade-in delay-1">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-9 h-9 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 font-bold flex-shrink-0">1</span>
                    Primary Sources
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-12">
                    We start with official state government websites, legislative documents, and state archives.
                    This ensures that all designations we list are official and up-to-date.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 fade-in delay-2">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-9 h-9 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 font-bold flex-shrink-0">2</span>
                    Cross-Checking
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-12">
                    We cross-check our findings with reliable educational references and reputable databases
                    to provide additional historical and cultural context.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 fade-in delay-3">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-9 h-9 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 font-bold flex-shrink-0">3</span>
                    Editorial Review
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-12">
                    Content is reviewed for clarity, accuracy, and consistency. We focus on making complex information
                    easy to understand without oversimplifying important details.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 fade-in delay-3">
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-3 flex items-center">
                    <span class="w-9 h-9 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mr-3 font-bold flex-shrink-0">4</span>
                    Ongoing Updates
                </h3>
                <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed ml-12">
                    State symbols can change over time. We monitor updates and adjust our pages accordingly so the
                    information remains current.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

